Package: atRfunctions
Title: wrap-up ATR's custom functions
Version: 0.0.5
Authors@R:
    person("ATR", "Data Management Team", , "datamanagement.atr@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Wraps the custom functions used most frequently by the ATR
    Data Management Team for survey data workflows. Supports both Kobo and
